      "text": "How to gather requirements for low level design interview ? \n-> this include lld and machine coding. ( long requirements \nproduction ready , real world ) \n\n-> gather requirement is very important, you can't directly jump to \n    class diagram , like in real world as well you've given PRD , you\n  digest that PRD, ask doubts, understand the things. then \n  later on come on the implementatoin of design.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How to gather requirements for low level design interview ? \n-> this include lld and machine coding. ( long requirements \nproduction ready , real world ) \n\n-> gather requirement is very important, you can't directly jump to \n    class diagram , like in real world as well you've given PRD , you\n  digest that PRD, ask doubts, understand the things. then \n  later on come on the implementatoin of design.",
