      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Understanding/doubts/requiremets ( rough ): \n-> need to develop PG like razorpay for client like flipkart to receive payment ( pay in,  payment\n   gate way send the request to flipkart bank , then flipkart bank send request to upi layer/credit card layer \n   and ask for tranferring money to flipkart bank , payment gate send response as per flipkart bank respnose, assuming\n    chatgpt as interviewer. )\n\n-> cosumer -> flipkart for paying via multiple mode.\n        -> flow -> user click 100rs -> tell multiple py modes\n        -> user select some mode -> call pg api for that mode\n        -> to receive the payment -> pg will get credential \n        -> it will fetch money from user bank's account -> then \n        -> it will transfer to flipkart bank account. \n\n-> paymode -> can be on PG level -> how many payment mode it support\n               -> also can be on client level -> which mdoes this particular \n                   client is using right ? ( 1:m ) \n\n-> mode <-> banking -> at client level , like which bank to send as per payment\n             -> mode, there would be some default as well. \n    bascially -> PG can support multiple bank. \n    and client -> can integration multiple bank out of given by PG\n    and client tell how to route to which bank of their.\n\n\n-> what is traffic distribution \n    -> ( assuming chatgpt as interviewer)\n    -> we can route load to multiple bank for one payment mode\n        -> like for credit cart -> 40% to icici\n          -> and 60% to hdfc. something like this. \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Understanding/doubts/requiremets ( rough ): \n-> need to develop PG like razorpay for client like flipkart to receive payment ( pay in,  payment\n   gate way send the request to flipkart bank , then flipkart bank send request to upi layer/credit card layer \n   and ask for tranferring money to flipkart bank , payment gate send response as per flipkart bank respnose, assuming\n    chatgpt as interviewer. )\n\n-> cosumer -> flipkart for paying via multiple mode.\n        -> flow -> user click 100rs -> tell multiple py modes\n        -> user select some mode -> call pg api for that mode\n        -> to receive the payment -> pg will get credential \n        -> it will fetch money from user bank's account -> then \n        -> it will transfer to flipkart bank account. \n\n-> paymode -> can be on PG level -> how many payment mode it support\n               -> also can be on client level -> which mdoes this particular \n                   client is using right ? ( 1:m ) \n\n-> mode <-> banking -> at client level , like which bank to send as per payment\n             -> mode, there would be some default as well. \n    bascially -> PG can support multiple bank. \n    and client -> can integration multiple bank out of given by PG\n    and client tell how to route to which bank of their.\n\n\n-> what is traffic distribution \n    -> ( assuming chatgpt as interviewer)\n    -> we can route load to multiple bank for one payment mode\n        -> like for credit cart -> 40% to icici\n          -> and 60% to hdfc. something like this. \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
