      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow: \n client -> register\n                 -> banks\n                 -> payment modes\n                 -> config -> mode -> bank and mode -> percentages of banks.\npg-> makepayment\n        -> to call bank to shift money \n\nfor us -> user -> client\n\nEntities: \n\n-> Client\n-> Banks\n-> PaymentMethod\n-> clientPMMapping\n    -> PMroutingCriteria.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow: \n client -> register\n                 -> banks\n                 -> payment modes\n                 -> config -> mode -> bank and mode -> percentages of banks.\npg-> makepayment\n        -> to call bank to shift money \n\nfor us -> user -> client\n\nEntities: \n\n-> Client\n-> Banks\n-> PaymentMethod\n-> clientPMMapping\n    -> PMroutingCriteria.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "N7QPV84lEzbFdC7VRU0xr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3246.940655300759,
      "y": 1467.8356874001747,
