      "text": "Summary:\n\n-> understand requirement like you are building.\n-> understand the flow end to end\n-> understand the usecase important.\n-> basically image if we have ui for this , then how flow\n    will be happening\n-> ask doubt \n\n\n-> Output -> You understand the requirements well, you don't \n    have solution , but you got the requirements. ",
