      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1766661539925,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": ".....\n\nOnce we understood. \n\n-> Just write entities: \n-> keeping big picture in your mind and relation\n-> if this is machine coding round do this by making files in model. \n\n-> Now write few attributes in each entity and relation by writing has a object\nor list of object\n-> those attribute have different types or seems to be extendable in future,\ncreate its interface\n    and write its implmentations like here -> bank, payment method. \n-> No need to write mthod -> just tell it will have getter and setter, and will\nwrite other methods\n    if require in future, will add here. but these are just models. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": ".....\n\nOnce we understood. \n\n-> Just write entities: \n-> keeping big picture in your mind and relation\n-> if this is machine coding round do this by making files in model. \n\n-> Now write few attributes in each entity and relation by writing has a object or list of object\n-> those attribute have different types or seems to be extendable in future, create its interface\n    and write its implmentations like here -> bank, payment method. \n-> No need to write mthod -> just tell it will have getter and setter, and will write other methods\n    if require in future, will add here. but these are just models. ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BTj63N40697qos55ndNMr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4976.397040192614,
      "y": 997.5518704553643,
      "width": 800.6793823242188,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
